#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:223
msgid ""
"The dimensions of related to the arrow are presented in <xref linkend=\"fig-"
"gnumeric-graphics-drawing-arrow-dimensions\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Pilens mått visas i <xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-drawing-arrow-"
"dimensions\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:230
msgid "The dimensions of the arrow point."
msgstr "Pilspetsens mått."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:234
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/arrowhead-dimensions.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image describing "
"the dimensions of the arrow head. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/arrowhead-dimensions.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild som visar "
"pilspetsens mått.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:248
msgid ""
"The 'Arrow Tip' is the distance from the point of the arrow to the base of "
"the arrowhead where the shaft begins. The 'Arrow Length' is the distance "
"from the arrow point to either of the outer side points of the arrow head, "
"projected along the shaft of the arrow. The 'Arrow Width' is the distance "
"between the two outer side points of the arrow head."
msgstr ""
"”Pilspets” är avståndet från pilens spets till pilhuvudets bas, där skaftet "
"börjar. ”Pillängd” är avståndet från pilspetsen till någon av pilhuvudets "
"yttre sidopunkter, mätt längs skaftet. ”Pilbredd” är avståndet mellan "
"pilhuvudets två yttre sidopunkter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:264
msgid "Drawing Rectangles."
msgstr "Rita rektanglar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:266
msgid ""
"Rectangles are areal drawing elements. <xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-"
"graphics-drawings-rectangle-example\"/> shows a yellow rectangle with a blue"
" border."
msgstr ""
"Rektanglar är ytfigurer. <xref linkend=\"fig-gnumeric-graphics-drawings-"
"rectangle-example\"/> visar en gul rektangel med blå kantlinje."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:272
msgid ""
"Rectangles have three properties which can be configured, the color and "
"width of the border and the color of the interior of the rectangle."
msgstr ""
"Du kan konfigurera tre egenskaper för rektangeln: kantlinjens färg och bredd"
" samt rektangelns fyllningsfärg."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:279
msgid "A rectangle drawing element."
msgstr "En rektangel."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:283
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/drawing-rectangle.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of a "
"rectangle drawing element. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/drawing-rectangle.png\" "
"format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av en "
"rektangel.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:298
msgid "Configuring the properties of the rectangle"
msgstr "Konfigurera rektangelns egenskaper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:300
msgid ""
"The properties of the rectangle can be altered with the "
"<guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu item in the context menu which "
"appears when the mouse cursor is placed over the rectangle and one of the "
"secondary mouse buttons is pressed."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra rektangelns egenskaper med menyalternativet "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem> i snabbmenyn. Öppna menyn genom att "
"föra muspekaren över rektangeln och trycka på en sekundär musknapp."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:310
msgid "The configuration dialog for rectangle properties."
msgstr "Dialogrutan för rektangelns egenskaper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:314
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-rectangle.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase> An image of the "
"dialog used to configure rectangle drawing elements. </phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/dialog-properties-rectangle.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av dialogrutan"
" för att konfigurera rektanglar.</phrase> </textobject>"
